        "client_msg_id": "1D9A99F5-7030-47FA-8F9D-04472396B3DE",
        "text": "It\u2019s that layout algorithm where you ask all of your subviews, \u201cHow big would you want to be if you had [this much space]?\u201d then tell them, \u201cOkay, I\u2019m giving you [this much space], lay out your subviews.\u201d\n\nI don\u2019t know the name for it! But it meant the table was easy: it just takes max() of all the heights and widths for the cells in every row and column.\n\nI draw the wires in a second pass using the world coordinates of the THREE.Object3Ds post-layout.",
